	(text "Supplies: DCVDD/AVDD/PLLVDD/CPVDD from CODEC_1V8 (+1V8 via R79, EVKB R2116), DBVDD and MICVDD from +3V3 (MICVDD 1.7-3.6V; EVKB used 2.8V), SPKVDD1/2 from +5V (class-D unused, outputs open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 48.26 0)
		(effects
